{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-35","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：连比例与比例与整数","englishTitle":"If as many numbers as we please be in continued proportion, and there be subtracted from the second and the last numbers equal to the first, then, as the excess of the second is to the first, so will the excess of the last be to all those before it.","book":9,"number":35,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.35","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.35/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":35,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-35@raw-ec7d0f617743752c","contentId":"euclid-9-35","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ec7d0f617743752ce4f5431c16fe2b5adc04bf3192710865106ecddb4b435600","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-35.statement","euclid-9-35.construction.1","euclid-9-35.construction.2","euclid-9-35.proof.1","euclid-9-35.proof.2","euclid-9-35.proof.3","euclid-9-35.proof.4","euclid-9-35.proof.5","euclid-9-35.conclusion","euclid-9-35.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-35.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-35","revisionId":"euclid-9-35@raw-ec7d0f617743752c","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1608bb535ad911817cefca4616818bc349021c331ce528dd2dbb7e9ef8779612","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If as many numbers as we please be in continued proportion, and there be subtracted from the second and the last numbers equal to the first, then, as the excess of the second is to the first, so will the excess of the last be to all those before it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果连比例我们想多算多少,从第二个数字和最后一个数字中减去第一个数字,那么,第二个数字的溢额是第一个数字,最后数字的溢额也是所有前列数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-35.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-35","revisionId":"euclid-9-35@raw-ec7d0f617743752c","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"51a6f740d57ae4714c20bd4588f50b10b99286e656e0b8237ad5970f545a17ae","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be as many numbers as we please in continued proportion, A, BC, D, EF, beginning from A as least, and let there be subtracted from BC and EF the numbers BG, FH, each equal to A; I say that, as GC is to A, so is EH to A, BC, D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让我们在连比例、A、BC、D、EF中尽量多地列出数字,从A起算,从BC和EF中减去BG、FH,各等于A;我说,GC-A的比等于EH-A、BC、D；GC 与 A 之比等于 EH 与 A 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-35.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-9-35","revisionId":"euclid-9-35@raw-ec7d0f617743752c","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"439d0214bcbe539ace6cb618dc44fb31600e69290a35206dcf82393d0ac9a0f3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let FK be made equal to BC, and FL equal to D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FK等于BC,FL等于D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-35.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-35","revisionId":"euclid-9-35@raw-ec7d0f617743752c","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d8e2f6e93a6ad37abc0a9eac65534fa1f10b9c179f3a85cae8a3db4a40c0b71a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since FK is equal to BC, and of these the part FH is equal to the part BG, therefore the remainder HK is equal to the remainder GC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FK等于BC,其中FH等于BG,因此其余HK等于其余GC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-35.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-35","revisionId":"euclid-9-35@raw-ec7d0f617743752c","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0d9ba386af724c197f020bbc3cf4ad5c3d3e54945929a606cdc265c902cecba3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, as EF is to D, so is D to BC, and BC to A, while D is equal to FL, BC to FK, and A to FH, therefore, as EF is to FL, so is LF to FK, and FK to FH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EF对D的比等于D对BC和BC对A的比,D对FK的比等于FL、BC对FK,A对FH,EF对FL的比等于LF对FK和FH的比；EF 与 D 之比等于 D 与 BC 之比；EF 与 FL 之比等于 LF 与 FK 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-35.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-9-35","revisionId":"euclid-9-35@raw-ec7d0f617743752c","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7e0908aa8cef5ff64a63f97b759b7efb2ce2b8baf8ba8bbfba697b3f4726bc9c","citations":["euclid-7-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Separando, as EL is to LF, so is LK to FK, and KH to FH. [[VII. 11, 13](/principles/euclid-7-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"分比,EL比LF等于LK比FK,KH比FH；EL 与 LF 之比等于 LK 与 FK 之比。 [[VII. 11, 13](/principles/euclid-7-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-35.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-9-35","revisionId":"euclid-9-35@raw-ec7d0f617743752c","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7f174f2efdd79f6b7f1038a93da61f2819c377a4cc17e0a5f300205a749d8241","citations":["euclid-7-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also, as one of the antecedents is to one of the consequents, so are all the antecedents to all the consequents; [[VII. 12](/principles/euclid-7-12)] therefore, as KH is to FH, so are EL, LK. KH to LF, FK, HF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此，一个前项与对应后项之比，等于全部前项之和与全部后项之和的比；于是 KH 与 FH 之比，等于 EL、LK、KH 的总和与 LF、FK、HF 的总和之比。 [[VII. 12](/principles/euclid-7-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-35.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-9-35","revisionId":"euclid-9-35@raw-ec7d0f617743752c","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e501cae6384fe5fce83de4f5c8af4307af25a812c615daac25c5bf0b97a69861","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But KH is equal to CG, FH to A, and LF, FK, HF to D, BC, A; therefore, as CG is to A, so is EH to D, BC, A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但KH等于CG,FH至A,LF,FK,HF至D,BC,A;因此,CG至A的比等于EH至D,BC,A的比；CG 与 A 之比等于 EH 与 D 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-35.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-35","revisionId":"euclid-9-35@raw-ec7d0f617743752c","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8439c066e8f82d8c6a9b878040bd56747558e47b49a344d9ff14808515a60391","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as the excess of the second is to the first, so is the excess of the last to all those before it. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,第二比第一的溢额比等于最后比所有前的溢额比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-35.source","contentId":"euclid-9-35","revisionId":"euclid-9-35@raw-ec7d0f617743752c","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7a76b48ee6d2528d8a3aec1834e28496eb4c7401cae4186823611caecb9b90b9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.35/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.35\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-35:euclid-7-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-35","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-35.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.35","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.35/","sourceLabel":"VII. 11, 13"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-9-35:euclid-7-13:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-35","sourceBlockIds":[],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-13","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.35","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.35/","sourceLabel":"VII. 11, 13"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-9-35:euclid-7-12:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-35","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-35.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-12","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.35","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.35/","sourceLabel":"VII. 12"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-36:euclid-9-35:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-36","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-36.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-9-35","type":"depends_on","pro